#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:2 e038fd36b2844c2f837dc9332b04cfc8
msgid "_`Metadata Configuration`"
msgstr "元数据配置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:5 8ffc98a6547145b083c06687b0fd93dd
msgid "_`Project-level Settings`"
msgstr "项目级设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:7 7cc351e81aa641889931f4d341b1294f
msgid ""
"The metadata.json file contains the metadata configuration for the fcpp "
"project, including basic project information, build configuration, and "
"dependency definitions."
msgstr ""
"metadata.json 文件包含 fcpp 项目的元数据配置，包括基本项目信息、构建配置和"
"依赖定义。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:11 2a63b984d8be4c0595f65d0af4bd364a
msgid "_`File Structure`"
msgstr "文件结构"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:13 c129fc51da494d4f9b97452c658ce102
msgid ""
"The JSON file includes sections for basic project information (name, "
"version, license, description), authors and maintainers, build "
"configuration (CMake version, C/C++ standards), module settings, "
"dependency definitions, and documentation configuration."
msgstr ""
"该 JSON 文件包含基本项目信息（名称、版本、许可证、描述）、作者和维护者、"
"构建配置（CMake 版本、C/C++ 标准）、模块设置、依赖定义以及文档配置等部分。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:18 1642bd1c563b4f07864db733210c174f
msgid "_`Key Settings`"
msgstr "关键设置"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:20 8f6171353602444d8058ca571a7c82c6
msgid ""
"Basic project information defines the package identity. Build "
"configuration specifies tool versions and language standards. Module "
"settings control standard and user module usage. Dependencies are "
"categorized into common, C-specific, and C++-specific requirements. "
"Documentation settings configure Doxygen generation."
msgstr ""
"基本项目信息定义了包的身份标识。构建配置指定了工具版本和语言标准。模块"
"设置控制标准和用户模块的使用。依赖项被归类为通用、C 专用和 C++ 专用需求。"
"文档设置用于配置 Doxygen 生成。"

#: ../../source/components/meta.rst:24 a1dc0c323d4643299ad758742d74cdc4
msgid ""
"Example configuration demonstrates how to set up a project with C++20 "
"support, module generation, and common dependencies like Boost and "
"OpenCV."
msgstr ""
"示例配置展示了如何设置一个支持 C++20、模块生成以及包含 Boost 和 OpenCV "
"等通用依赖的项目。"